# NEGATIVE CONTROL (reset PC mutated in neg_rtl/hdl/datapath.v). FLOW_JOURNAL Incident 86, SEC gold: final RTL (EQY's gold front end) + OpenLane's pre-fsm
# steps + `fsm` (that step proved separately: ../fsm_recode/prove_fsm.ys) + the EQY [script]
# tail up to memory_map. Async resets are kept as $adff here; the miter maps them.
script gold_front_end_neg.ys
proc
opt_expr
opt_clean
opt -nodffe -nosdff
fsm
hierarchy -top soc_asic_top
proc
prep -top soc_asic_top -flatten
memory -nomap
memory_map
opt_clean
check -assert -initdrv
write_ilang gold_pre_neg.il
